OL,3,GNEWSAPC denies using excessive force
OL,4,Aduring restraint
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer who restrained a man
OL,7,Fwho fell unconscious and later died has
OL,8,Ftold an inquest the force he used was
OL,9,F"proportionate".
OL,11,FRoberto Villa, 37, was held by West
OL,12,FYorkshire Police officers at the
OL,13,FEdgerton Hotel in Huddersfield on 4
OL,14,FDecember 2018.
OL,16,FAt his inquest at Bradford Coroner's
OL,17,FCourt, Fiona Murphy KC, representing
OL,18,FVilla's family, claimed PC Anthony
OL,19,FSpiteri's use of force was "excessive,
OL,20,Funreasonable and disproportionate".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
