OL,3,GNEWSAPC denies using excessive force
OL,4,Aduring restraint
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpiteri, who took Villa to the ground
OL,7,Fduring the restraint, told the court:
OL,8,F"It was proportionate ` I had been
OL,9,Fattacked."
